WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.689
Views solve several problems at once They let us
centralize shared

00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:11.241
SQL logic They create a stable interface with
deliberate columns

00:00:11.268 --> 00:00:17.261
and row meaning They can reduce accidental exposure
by omitting unnecessary

00:00:17.288 --> 00:00:23.897
fields although actual authorization still depends
on database security controls And

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:29.016
materialized views can store reusable results when
freshness does not need to be immediate
